	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Also at 3rd level, you begin to master the stances of the gun kata, which train you to take on specific fighting forms to minimize the opportunity of counter attacks. You do not face disadvantage when using light firearms while within 5ft of an opponent or even while grappled. In addition, you may make a single attack with a light firearm as a bonus action on your turn, but only if your target is within the first range increment of the firearm.</p>",
